flowchart LR
    O[Observe<br/>Collect evidence] --> R[Orient<br/>Context, risk, identity, rights]
    R --> D[Decide<br/>Authorize or deny]
    D --> A[Act<br/>Execute reversible action]
    A --> AU[Audit and Appeal<br/>Record, challenge, restore]
    AU --> O

    SSOT[SSOT Truth Check] --> O
    SSOT --> R
    SSOT --> D
    CIPSE[CIPSE(D²) Moral Constraints] --> R
    CIPSE --> D
    ZT[Zero Trust Gate] --> D
    ZT --> A
